        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Here you go. Bread and clean water, all in here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Incredible, you are! Fought 'em off, no, wiped 'em out alone, all those gloompincers... Didn't expect one young lady like you'd finish up that job in half an afternoon."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Even going out all together, the young'uns couldn't handle it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Frankly, it gave me a scare, our town being so small. And I've never seen someone fight as ferocious as you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "...I'll be fine without."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Don't want any bread or water? Well... alright, we've got some medicine here too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "It's from the caravan that passed through last time. We had to trade them a good amount for it. They were worth plenty, I'll tell you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "By the sights of it, you've been hurt bad, haven't you? You could probably use it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "I don't need it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Th-Then what do you need? Gold coins? That'll be tough. We're only a little town, and rabble comes by shaking us down every few days, plus all the beasts making trouble out there..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Our pockets are all emptied out by the end of the year. Barely a penny we've got."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "The day before. People sighted a Kuranta the day before, black clothing and a crossbow, heading this way."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "Tell me where they are."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Crossbow? The kind you use for hunting?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "The kind to murder."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "M-Murder?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "You've got to be joking... no, the look in your eyes says you aren't joking one bit... how frightful... *cough* How could someone like that show up in a little place like ours?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "Don't screw with me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "I-I-I-I-Is that a weapon? Don't, erm, please don't shoot! I swear, I haven't seen anyone like the person you describe\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "The ones in the last village saw. And told me. They went this way."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Per... perhaps they already passed through here, went south? There's an even bigger town that way, more food, cleaner water..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.3,
            "xstrength": 10,
            "ystrength": 12,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Oh, god, Heaven above! Miss, god, believe me, please, I've got no reason to lie to you at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kazimierz Villager",
        "text": "Look, please, here, this is the last of my family's money, we were saving it for the year-end tax, this is all we've got, have it, have it all..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_158_milu",
            "name2": "avg_npc_005",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "I said, I don't need it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "Forget it. You can go."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
