    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "What's this?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "Bread, and water. And medicine."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "He was scared so bad, he ran off without a trace, and yet he still deliberately came back in after."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "Is he trying to show thanks? But it was only a few gloompincers, nothing more. It took no effort on my part."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Firewatch",
        "text": "People like him... do remind me... of back then."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
